msgid "Šta je to Luen Pro?"
msgstr "What is Luen Pro?"

msgid "Zajednica umova<br class=\"desktop-break\"> zaljubljenih u marketing."
msgstr "A community of minds<br class=\"desktop-break\"> in love with marketing."

msgid "Svaki brend ima svoj identitet, priču i specifičnost. Zato svakom klijentu pristupamo pojedinačno, pažljivo i maksimalno fokusirano."
msgstr "Every brand has its own identity, story and character. That is why we approach each client individually, carefully and with complete focus."

msgid "Ono što mi radimo, i to radimo maksimalno fokusirani, vođeni nesputanom kreativnošću i s puno ljubavi, jesu <span>ORGANIZACIJE DOGAĐAJA, IN STORE PROMOCIJE, KREATIVNA REŠENJA, DIGITALNI MARKETING i PRODUKCIJA.</span>"
msgstr "What we do — with complete focus, unbound creativity and a lot of love — is <span>EVENT ORGANIZATION, IN-STORE PROMOTIONS, CREATIVE SOLUTIONS, DIGITAL MARKETING and PRODUCTION.</span>"

msgid "Smatramo da je ključ uspešno sprovedenih projekata koji su za nama činjenica da se trudimo da ne slušamo klijente - trudimo se da ih čujemo i razumemo njihove potrebe. Zato, ko god želi da njegov brend bude shvaćen - Luen Pro je mesto za to!"
msgstr "The projects behind us worked because we try not only to listen to clients — we try to hear them and understand what they need. Whoever wants their brand to be understood, Luen Pro is the place."

msgid "NAŠ TIM"
msgstr "OUR TEAM"

msgid "RAZLIČITE VEŠTINE.<br>ZAJEDNIČKA IDEJA."
msgstr "DIFFERENT SKILLS.<br>ONE SHARED IDEA."

msgid "Spajamo kreativnost, iskustvo i tehnologiju da bismo stvarali jedinstvena iskustva sa brendovima — u fizičkom i digitalnom svetu."
msgstr "We bring creativity, experience and technology together to create distinct brand experiences — in the physical and the digital world."

